_:ndc8ff56f09c34329b16c0a589433e049b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\r\n        The reference formulation (rml:referenceFormulation) defines how to\r\n        reference to elements of the data of the input source.\r\n        " .
