_:n045dca8f27094cd8b37fdfde1db819deb1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:termType for Predicate Map can only be a rml:IRI, rml:UnsafeIRI,\n        rml:URI, or rml:UnsafeURI;\n        " .
_:ne1bb378bc2f54934a398b21e4e2796b4b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n                PREFIX rml: <http://w3id.org/rml/>\n                SELECT $this\n                WHERE {\n                    $this rml:constant ?value .\n                    FILTER (lang(?value) != \"\")\n                }\n            " .
_:n4e8146393e7940599bf01bf58de5669bb1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:n187828f816894949bfafb0c401356c49b11 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:objectMap must be an IRI or blank node and be provided once.\n        " .
_:n63baa6b25bc3435eaac9ec434b7c1ab8b11 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/termType> .
_:n045dca8f27094cd8b37fdfde1db819deb2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n045dca8f27094cd8b37fdfde1db819deb3 .
_:n4e8146393e7940599bf01bf58de5669bb2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:n38c512e5e068486482ba0eb4c6f34fa8b5 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A reference rml:reference is used to refer to a column in case of \n        databases, a record in case of CSV or TSV data source, an element in \n        case of XML data source, an object in case of a JSON data source, etc.\n\n        A reference must be a valid identifier, considering the reference \n        formulation (rml:referenceFormulation) specified. The reference can be\n        an absolute path, or a path relative to the iterator specified at the \n        logical source. \n        " .
_:n4e8146393e7940599bf01bf58de5669bb1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Exactly one rml:logicalSource is required to access the data source.\n        " .
_:nbeb5feba3fc54c8bba24d304e0427b82b7 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:n4e8146393e7940599bf01bf58de5669bb13 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:PredicateObjectMap must be an IRI or blank node.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLTriplesMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetSubjectsOf> <http://w3id.org/rml/logicalSource> .
